<title>ISRAEL: French President Chirac arrives in Gaza.</title>
<headline>French President Chirac arrives in Gaza.</headline>
<dateline>GAZA 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>French President Jacques Chirac arrived in the Gaza Strip on Wednesday after addressing the Palestinian parliament in the West Bank, witnesses said.</p>
<p>Chirac flew by helicopter to Gaza City accompanied by Palestinian President Yasser Arafat and was scheduled to lunch with him before touring Gaza port and travelling to Jordan later in the day.</p>
</text>
